{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S06、S13的感受提示过于密集，部分音乐术语和连续比喻容易让观众忙着追踪提示，反而漏掉人物叙事；X的左侧完整叙事在这方面更容易连续阅读。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用【】突出每段最重要的心理节点，话与感受交替出现，又让感受提示跟随音乐实际进程出现，观众更容易边听边抓住人物当下在想什么、为什么会这样。它对情绪转折的铺陈也更细腻，从不甘、怀念、短暂温暖，到孤独、犹疑，再到接纳和继续生活，前后有清楚的呼应。X的完整句子并不难懂，但右侧感受词较容易形成一堆需要自行归类的信息，人物故事与音乐细节之间的对应关系也没有Y那么清楚。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0759d3aa-84b2-4a49-a153-161445f5e1c1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T182219045114Z", "elapsed_seconds": 69.906, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T18:23:28.967473+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8d3c62e5889fd947d98aeabc415745ea28b5eb22ef4c19a95bcee8475c33b6d4", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", 